# vv-graph — P7 opt-out (PLAN_0_144_6 v0.1)
#
# This file satisfies P7 of the biological-interface contract
# (docs/architecture/principles/biological-interface-gem.md)
# by declaring an opt-out from the per-Turn L axis hook.
#
# Rationale: as of 2026-06-07 vv-graph emits no per-Turn
# observable signal that the extractor consumes. Closing the
# opt-out requires:
#
#   1. The extractor auto-discovers library/<gem>/loss/*.rb
#      (PLAN_0_144_4b), and
#   2. vv-graph ships a candidate axis from the list below.
#
# Candidate axes (any of):
#   * sparql_query_errors_delta  — normalised count of failed
#     Vv::Graph::Sparql.execute calls during the Turn.
#   * graph_consistency_drift    — ratio of orphaned IRIs
#     introduced vs total triples written.
#   * materialised_view_staleness — mean age (seconds) of
#     stale projections at Turn close.
#
# This marker is removed by PLAN_0_144_6a (vv-graph axis design).
# Until then, the gem is honestly opted-out + the alignment
# score reflects intent, not implementation.
